    {
      "id": "bridge-invariants",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Invariants",
      "position": {
        "x": 1550,
        "y": -1636
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Invariants",
        "body": "**What makes this thing an import or an export, specifically?**\n\n- A node is an `import` or an `export`, never both. Which end it is comes from its type, not a stored role. An import and an export are separate nodes even when they name the same `ref`.\n- It names a `resourceKind`: `node-class` (one custom node type), `library` (a bundle; an export of this kind with a class list is read by the create menu, and by nothing else — see Behavior), or `graph` (a whole graph, usually a template).\n- It names a `ref` — the concrete address of what it reaches.\n- For `resourceKind: node-class`, the granted type key must actually be set. An import with a `ref` but no key grants nothing the validator can see, even though the UI may show it as configured.\n- Its `grants` say what's permitted over the target (`read`, `create`, `update`, `execute`, `mutate`) — not every grant is meaningful for every `resourceKind`.\n- **The validator checks these** (a warning when a graph loads, an error when it is edited or saved): an import or export with no `ref` (`BRIDGE_REF_MISSING`); an import of a class with no `key` (`BRIDGE_CLASS_KEY_MISSING`); and a node of a class, named by its `data.classRef`, in a graph that imports neither that class nor a graph or kit that hands classes on (`CLASS_WITHOUT_IMPORT`). A class that has loaded for another graph does not count: a graph can use only the classes of its own imports.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "bridge",
          "updatedAt": 1791592047775,
          "reason": "bridge-reference"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "fe331a1c-0790-447b-ad05-83ddc1898214"
        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any",
          "position": {
            "side": "top",
            "offset": 0.2
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any",
          "position": {
            "side": "top",
            "offset": 0.2
          }
        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
