      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Known gaps",
        "body": "Resource-kind support depends on the actual consumer. The library-kind reservation above remains a limitation, not a promised expansion path. Runtime delivery and browser connection behavior require their own smoke evidence.",
